{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：中国银行业2Q26数据观察，国有大行与股份制银行表现分化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">央行和资金监管总局的2Q26银行业数据，在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>看来给出了一个相对清晰的信号：国有大行的盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>好于预期，而股份制银行的分化不确定性在加大。这份报告最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的判断是，行业季度净利润同比增速从1Q26的-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>到2Q26的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>，其中国有大行贡献了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>的增长，明显好于该机构此前的预测。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看几个关键数字。商业银行季度净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6030亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>；国有大行净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，较1Q26的-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>明显<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。股份制银行则相反，净利润同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，而<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>对覆盖的股份制银行原本预测约1%的增长。城商行和农商行分别增长5%和17%。净息差方面，行业整体环比回升3个基点至1.43%，国有大行回升3个基点至1.33%，股份制银行则微降1个基点至1.54%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXggPgk7lsCfDatReYroLplW1ptnLpekf8rIYRrSbGuChr5u88tQfGYIn4k2wG2ceIwnGUOOYicfqSZtAiaUsYeMZickhvpkJ2ovQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVF9sAic2uHd5YImrAjEyKEaZNCyQJf7wfe3N694EccKu0ITE9c7fG1tLstcUUIKPTrFKGz5oNXtSbfbicVaEC9Llqvz2pjWHbhE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUzJOt8UwKVXia4qgIP0gibg4hAibftawibYPMhhlia50wSQkwmyQ5ialrbacz2uUNXw44WOPAvc60ibuc9nibAGUg3Z2dHFEib4K8ZrzNU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">净息差的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>值得拆开看。报告指出，新增贷款定价仍在出现变化，2Q26加权平均贷款利率环比下降18个基点，逆转了1Q26上升8个基点的趋势；企业贷款利率下降10个基点，票据融资利率更是大跌52个基点。资产端回报表现节奏变化的不确定性，部分被负债成本下降所抵消——央行披露，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年6月新发生定期存款利率为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.28%</span>，环比下降3个基点，而覆盖银行的平均定期存款成本在2H25为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.99%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看新发放贷款利率和存款利率这两个数字的背离。简单说，资产端回报表现还在往下走，但负债端成本降得更快，净息差才勉强稳住；更值得观察的是存款成本下降的持续性，因为如果存款定期化趋势重新抬头，负债端<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>的空间就会收窄。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">资产质量方面，行业整体不良率环比微升1个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.52%</span>，关注类贷款占比上升4个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.21%</span>。结构上，国有大行不良率环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>1个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.21%</span>，股份制银行上升1个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.23%</span>，城商行和农商行不确定性更大，分别上升2个基点和4个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.87%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.83%</span>。拨备覆盖率行业整体稳定在202.9%，但股份制银行环比下降3个百分点至201.9%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">政策导向型贷款继续跑赢整体信贷增速。截至6月末，科技、绿色、普惠、养老和数字宏观环境贷款同比分别增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.6%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.5%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.3%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23.5%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.1%</span>，均高于总贷款<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.4%</span>的同比增速，但增速较1Q26有所节奏变化。先进制造业贷款占总贷款比重从1Q26末的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.4%</span>升至7.6%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">央行货币政策报告的几个专题栏目，在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>看来降低了短期内<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">降息</span>的可能性。报告强调资金支持实体宏观环境正在从规模<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>转向提质增效，债券、股权融资等直接融资渠道的作用上升；短端利率改革旨在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>流动性管理，但不必然意味着立即<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">宽松</span>。此外，央行提到海外央行加息带来的溢出效应，以及<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1万亿</span>元再贷款工具用于降低民营企业融资成本——该工具利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.25%</span>，截至7月末已使用约8000亿元。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 央行专题栏目释放的信号比数据本身更值得琢磨。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUdtHtdlrgMInBC9wtiaNO2aalEibEohwUpCQXgEfibsdVrEriaXSbt5XicE0HicfW5TR1a1skOzBRZp2mf3JDtSoxicEAKS2HUbuAcC8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 37-JPM-China banks-Reality check on PBOC - NFRA 2Q26 data- positive read-across to SOE banks while JSBs lag-260816</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
